                  "summary": {
                    "description": "The short score as the Match Day desk shows it in a row: a set sport's sets won, then the games and live points of the set in play (\"1–1 · 14–9\"; tennis \"1–0 · 3–2 · 40–30\", \"TB 3–2\"), the sport's own headline otherwise; the same form once finished (\"2–0\"). Never the full headline with every set's score. null before any.",
                    "anyOf": [
                      {
                        "type": "string"
                      },
                      {
                        "type": "null"
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                },
